{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0276","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000113:text","row":37627,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"早朝。","en":"Early morning.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902362","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00001","en":"Early morning.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000131:text","row":37628,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"惰性で部活に来てしまう。","en":"Sheer inertia brings me back to the club.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902363","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00002","en":"I came to club by inertia.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000161:text","row":37629,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"放送局の準備は、まだまだできていない。","en":"The broadcast station is still nowhere near ready.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902364","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00003","en":"The preparations for our Broadcast Station still had quite a long ways to go.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:0000019f:text","row":37630,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"友貴がいた。","en":"Tomoki is here.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902365","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00004","en":"Tomoki was among us.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:000001cb:text","row":37631,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「おは」","en":"“Morning.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902366","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00005","en":"Taichi: \"Morn'.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000271:text","row":37632,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"「……太一か」","en":"“...Taichi.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902367","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00006","en":"Tomoki: \"...Taichi, then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:0000029f:text","row":37633,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"「どした？」","en":"“What's up?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902368","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00007","en":"Taichi: \"What's up?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000349:text","row":37634,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「……これさ、もうだいぶできてるなって思って」","en":"“...I was just thinking—we've made a lot of progress on this.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902369","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00008","en":"Tomoki: \"...this, ya know, I was thinking that most of it was already finished.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000397:text","row":37635,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「まあ先輩が頑張ってたからな」","en":"“Well, Misato's been working hard.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902370","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00009","en":"Taichi: \"Well, this is Senpai doing her best.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:000003d5:text","row":37636,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「必要な機材も運んだし」","en":"“And we hauled over all the equipment we need.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902371","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00010","en":"Taichi: \"She's even carrying up the machine parts she needs.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says the necessary equipment has already been carried up. The English presents an ongoing action and narrows equipment to machine parts.","remedy":"We already carried up the necessary equipment.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":60,"start":9,"text":"She's even carrying up the machine parts she needs."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:0000042a:text","row":37637,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「……いつできるんだっけ？」","en":"“...When was it supposed to be finished?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902372","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00011","en":"Tomoki: \"...when was she going to finish this?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000466:text","row":37638,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「日曜じゃないかな。当初の予定だと」","en":"“Sunday, I think. That was the original plan.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902373","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00012","en":"Taichi: \"Sunday, wasn't it? I think. That was the initial plan.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:000004aa:text","row":37639,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「手伝うか？」","en":"“Want to help?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902374","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00013","en":"Taichi: \"Wanna help?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000556:text","row":37640,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや、やることあるから……」","en":"“No. I've got something to do...”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902375","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00014","en":"Tomoki: \"Nah, got stuff to do, so...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000594:text","row":37641,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「桜庭さあ、旅に出たぞ」","en":"“Sakuraba left on a journey, you know.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902376","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00015","en":"Taichi: \"Sakuraba, yannow, he went on a trip.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:000005e9:text","row":37642,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「みたいだね」","en":"“Looks that way.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902377","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00016","en":"Tomoki: \"So like him.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese means 'It looks that way' in response to the report that he left. The English instead comments that the behavior is characteristic of him.","remedy":"Looks like it.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":21,"start":9,"text":"So like him."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000617:text","row":37643,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「誘われたさ」","en":"“He invited me.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902378","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00017","en":"Taichi: \"I was invited.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000662:text","row":37644,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「こっちもだよ」","en":"“Me too.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902379","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00018","en":"Tomoki: \"Yup, me too.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000692:text","row":37645,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「あと俺は億万長者になってしまった……」","en":"“Also, I've become a multimillionaire...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902380","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00019","en":"Taichi: \"Afterwards, I became a billionaire somehow...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:000006f7:text","row":37646,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「へえ」","en":"“Huh.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902381","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00020","en":"Tomoki: \"Ehhh?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000717:text","row":37647,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"反応が薄い。","en":"Not much of a reaction.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902382","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00021","en":"Reaction's weak.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:0000073b:text","row":37648,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"他のことに気を取られていた。","en":"Something else has his attention.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902383","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00022","en":"There's something else he's preoccupied with.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000777:text","row":37649,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「冬子が死んだよ」","en":"“Touko died.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902384","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00023","en":"Taichi: \"Touko died by the way.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000827:text","row":37650,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………なに、言ってるんだよ」","en":"“…………What are you talking about?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902385","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00024","en":"Tomoki: \"......what... are you talking about.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:0000085f:text","row":37651,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"顔が引きつる。","en":"His face twitches.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902386","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00025","en":"Face twitches.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:0000088d:text","row":37652,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「なーんちゃって」","en":"“Juuust kidding.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902387","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00026","en":"Taichi: \"Juuust kiddin'!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:0000093d:text","row":37653,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「おまえはー！」","en":"“You—!”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902388","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00027","en":"Tomoki: \"Really youuu!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:0000096d:text","row":37654,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「やるかー！」","en":"“You wanna go?!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902389","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00028","en":"Taichi: \"Will you let me off easilyyy!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese is the narrator's challenge to fight: 'You wanna go?' The English asks whether Tomoki will let him off easily, reversing agency and changing the challenge into a plea.","remedy":"You wanna go?!","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":38,"start":9,"text":"Will you let me off easilyyy!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:000009b8:text","row":37655,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「……やめとくよ。そんな気分じゃないし」","en":"“...No. Forget it. I'm not in the mood.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902390","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00029","en":"Tomoki: \"...let's stop. I'm not in that mood.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000ab0:text","row":37656,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"校舎に戻っていく。","en":"He heads back toward the school building.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902391","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00030","en":"He goes to return inside the building.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000ae2:text","row":37657,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「参加しないのかー？」","en":"“You're not helping?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902392","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00031","en":"Taichi: \"Won't you participaaate?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000b96:text","row":37658,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「……姉貴とケンカ中だしな」","en":"“...I'm in the middle of a fight with my sister.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902393","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00032","en":"Tomoki: \"...I'm fighting with Aneki ya know.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000bd2:text","row":37659,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「先輩、来るの遅いから午前だけでも手伝って行けよ」","en":"“Misato's getting here late, so help out this morning at least.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902394","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00033","en":"Taichi: \"Senpai comes in late, so come help us even if it's only before noon!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000c41:text","row":37660,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「うーん……わからないところとかあるの？」","en":"“Hmm... Is there anything you don't know how to do?”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902395","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00034","en":"Tomoki: \"Hummm... you got some things you don't get?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000c8b:text","row":37661,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「機材の配線わかんねー」","en":"“Don't know how to wire the equipment.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902396","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00035","en":"Taichi: \"Just a biiit on the wiring of the machinery.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000d41:text","row":37662,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"「仕方ないな」","en":"“Guess I have no choice.”","speakerJa":"友貴","speakerEn":"Tomoki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902397","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00036","en":"Tomoki: \"I just gotta, right.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0276:00000d67:text","row":37663,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"友貴は午前中だけ手伝ってくれた。","en":"Tomoki helped out for the morning.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:902398","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4017:00037","en":"Tomoki came to assist us only throughout the forenoon.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
